  "notes": "4-channel active DI box (19\" rack, IEC mains). Per channel: 6.35 mm TS INPUT and an unbalanced XLR INPUT, LINK (unbalanced parallel output) and transformer-balanced XLR OUTPUT. The LINK connector type is not in the specifications (listed as 6.35 mm jack). XLR genders are not stated in the guide; the usual convention (inputs female, outputs male) is used. Controls from the Quick Start Guide: per channel +20 dB, HIGH CUT (8 kHz), PHASE REVERSE, GND LIFT and two -20 dB attenuation switches; POWER switch. Modelled: with POWER off the balanced OUTPUT carries nothing; LINK (parallel output) always works. The guide describes one channel; the switches are taken to exist on each of the 4 channels.",
